Author:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
AuthorDate: Mon Jan 27 19:12:27 2025 +0200
Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Mon Jan 27 19:12:27 2025 +0200

    Bug 1881708 - Add onCreated, onUpdated and onDeleted events to messages.tags API. r=mkmelin


    This patch adds a TagTracker to be notified about added, removed and
    updated message tag definitions.

    Additionally, the method browser.messages.tags.update() learned how to
    set the ordinal property.

    This patch includes a small change in nsMsgTagService.cpp: For newly
    created tags, the ordinal preference is now set before the color
    preference, so any listener knows that the process of adding a tag has
    finished, once the color of the new tag has been set. This is needed,
    because the ordinal property is optional, and its preference may or may
    not be set. See

    https://searchfox.org/comm-central/rev/c14d0255ba0212400518006580a087db8a04984a/mailnews/base/src/nsMsgTagService.cpp#300-310

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D235449

diff --git a/mail/components/extensions/ExtensionMessages.sys.mjs b/mail/components/extensions/ExtensionMessages.sys.mjs
